        items: [
          { zh: "政府宣布了一系列抑制通膨的新措施，但經濟學家對成效存疑。", en: "The government has announced a series of new measures to curb inflation, but economists doubt their effectiveness.", alt: ["The government announced a series of new measures to curb inflation, but economists doubt their effectiveness.", "The government has announced a series of new measures to curb inflation, but economists are skeptical about their effectiveness.", "The government has announced a series of new measures to fight inflation, but economists doubt their effectiveness."], note: "curb = 抑制；doubt / be skeptical about = 存疑" },
          { zh: "據報導，雙方已同意停火，但當地仍不斷傳出零星衝突。", en: "Both sides have reportedly agreed to a ceasefire, but sporadic clashes are still being reported.", alt: ["Both sides have reportedly agreed to a ceasefire, although sporadic clashes are still being reported.", "Both sides have reportedly agreed to a ceasefire, but sporadic fighting is still being reported.", "Reportedly, both sides have agreed to a ceasefire, but sporadic clashes are still being reported."], note: "reportedly = 據報導；are being reported（現在進行式被動）" },
          { zh: "失業率創下十年新低，部分原因是更多人退出了勞動市場。", en: "The unemployment rate has hit a ten-year low, partly because more people have left the labor market.", alt: ["The unemployment rate has hit a ten-year low, partly because more people have left the workforce.", "Unemployment has hit a ten-year low, partly because more people have left the labor market.", "The unemployment rate has fallen to a ten-year low, partly because more people have left the labor market."], note: "ten-year low：year 不加 s；partly because = 部分原因是" },
          { zh: "這起醜聞不但損害了公司的聲譽，也導致股價重挫。", en: "The scandal not only damaged the company's reputation but also caused its share price to plunge.", alt: ["Not only did the scandal damage the company's reputation, but it also caused its share price to plunge.", "The scandal not only damaged the company's reputation but also caused its stock price to plunge.", "The scandal not only hurt the company's reputation but also caused its share price to plummet."], note: "not only A but also B；放句首要倒裝 Not only did…；cause + 受詞 + to V" },
          { zh: "調查仍在進行中，警方拒絕透露更多細節。", en: "The investigation is still ongoing, and the police have declined to release any further details.", alt: ["The investigation is still ongoing, and police have declined to release any further details.", "The investigation is still under way, and the police have declined to reveal any further details.", "The investigation is ongoing, and the police have refused to release any further details."], note: "decline to V = 婉拒；police 當複數（have）" },
          { zh: "專家警告，若不立即採取行動，極端天氣將變得更加頻繁。", en: "Experts warn that unless immediate action is taken, extreme weather will become even more frequent.", alt: ["Experts warn that if immediate action isn't taken, extreme weather will become even more frequent.", "Experts have warned that unless immediate action is taken, extreme weather will become even more frequent.", "Experts warn that unless we act immediately, extreme weather will become even more frequent."], note: "unless action is taken（被動）；even more + 形容詞" },
          { zh: "這項法案在國會引發激烈辯論，預計下個月才會付諸表決。", en: "The bill has sparked a heated debate in Congress and is not expected to be put to a vote until next month.", alt: ["The bill sparked a heated debate in Congress and isn't expected to be put to a vote until next month.", "The bill has sparked a heated debate in Congress and isn't expected to be voted on until next month.", "The bill has sparked a fierce debate in Congress and is not expected to go to a vote until next month."], note: "not … until next month = 下個月才…；be put to a vote = 付諸表決" },
          { zh: "儘管經濟放緩，消費者信心依然強勁，這讓分析師相當意外。", en: "Despite the economic slowdown, consumer confidence remains strong, which has surprised analysts.", alt: ["Despite the economic slowdown, consumer confidence has remained strong, which has surprised analysts.", "Consumer confidence remains strong despite the economic slowdown, which has surprised analysts.", "Despite the economic slowdown, consumer confidence remains strong, surprising analysts."], note: "which 指前面整件事；despite + 名詞" },
          { zh: "該公司否認所有指控，並表示將對散布不實訊息的人採取法律行動。", en: "The company denied all the allegations and said it would take legal action against anyone spreading false information.", alt: ["The company denied all allegations and said it would take legal action against anyone spreading false information.", "The company denied all the allegations and said it would take legal action against anyone who spreads false information.", "The company has denied all the allegations and says it will take legal action against anyone spreading false information."], note: "anyone spreading… = anyone who spreads…（分詞修飾）" },
          { zh: "這場危機暴露了醫療體系長期存在的缺陷，也引發了改革的呼聲。", en: "The crisis has exposed long-standing flaws in the healthcare system and prompted calls for reform.", alt: ["The crisis exposed long-standing flaws in the healthcare system and prompted calls for reform.", "The crisis has exposed longstanding flaws in the healthcare system and prompted calls for reform.", "The crisis has exposed long-standing flaws in the healthcare system and sparked calls for reform."], note: "prompt calls for reform = 引發改革的呼聲" },
          { zh: "抗議者聚集在市政府外，要求市長為這次的疏失負責。", en: "Protesters gathered outside City Hall, demanding that the mayor take responsibility for the failure.", alt: ["Protesters gathered outside City Hall, demanding the mayor take responsibility for the failure.", "Protesters gathered outside City Hall to demand that the mayor take responsibility for the failure.", "Protesters gathered outside City Hall, calling on the mayor to take responsibility for the failure."], note: "demand that + 主詞 + 原形（the mayor take，不加 s）" },
          { zh: "這項政策的長期影響仍有待觀察，但初步數據顯示效果有限。", en: "The long-term impact of the policy remains to be seen, but early data suggest its effect has been limited.", alt: ["The long-term impact of the policy remains to be seen, but early data suggests its effect has been limited.", "The long-term impact of this policy remains to be seen, but preliminary data suggest its effect has been limited.", "The long-term effects of the policy remain to be seen, but early data suggest the impact has been limited."], note: "remain to be seen = 仍有待觀察；data suggest（正式用法當複數）" }
        ]
